# G8 (graphics): a dialog dragged by its title bar. About is taken by its title, dragged and let go (the box and its OK button stand where it
# was dropped, and a click there closes it); Find is dragged past the foot of the screen and stops 16 pixels from it, Esc closes it, and
# the next Find opens in the middle again. Every frame's CRC-32 must equal the host's in both graphics modes.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
@click 425 9            # Help menu
@click 425 50           # About
@down 320 144           # the title bar taken
@move 360 164
@move 380 184           # mid-drag
@up 380 184             # dropped
@click 356 365          # OK, where it is now
@click 145 9            # Find menu
@click 215 32          # Find...
@down 320 177           # the title bar taken
@move 500 330
@move 639 479           # past the foot of the screen
@up 639 479
@click 320 177          # the old place is the page's now
esc
@click 145 9
@click 215 32           # Find opens in the middle again
@click 236 292          # Close
f10 end enter
